{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["The owner of the pit — the one who digs it open or excavates it." "And the dead shall be his — by the plain sense: since he pays its full value in justice, it follows that the dead animal belongs to the one who caused the damage. But the Sages explained: to the injured party, for the depreciation of the carcass belongs to the injured party."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:28.939748413Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}